\addvspace {10\p@ }
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces Optimized coefficient values for flexor and extensor configurations. $\text {X}_0$ is a constant length offset (in meters), $\text {X}_1$ and $\text {X}_2$ are stiffness values (in N/m) in the bracket's X and Y directions, respectively, and $\text {X}_3$ is the unitless wrapping factor.}}{98}{table.caption.31}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces Goodness of fit for the improved torque model across test configurations. RMSE and maximum absolute residual are in $\text {N}\cdot \text {m}$.}}{103}{table.caption.36}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4.3}{\ignorespaces Bi-pulley batch on five muscle sites of the robot-body model's OpenSim leg (2026-09-26). Objective 101 is the batch's infeasibility sentinel; all five runs closed with a nonpositive torque margin. The soleus and tibialis-anterior runs converged feasibly (pattern-search exit flag 1), and their objectives are the normalized torque shortfalls; the remaining three runs exited with flag $-2$.}}{110}{table.caption.37}%
