\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5.2}{\ignorespaces Principal feedback-pathway records of the database's Feedback table, named by the fixed grammar of afferent, action, and phase. Linked papers are counted over the full audited corpus of 943 papers; for every pathway listed, the count is unchanged under the retained corpus of 561. Demonstrating references are the corpus papers linked to each record, as curated in the database.}}{125}{table.caption.40}%
